' Run test: the demo in examples/demo, built from its own files, so it
' cannot quietly stop compiling or working. Keys: the Controls form
' (typing, a digits-only box refusing a letter, a password, access keys,
' Default), the Lists form (arrows, Space in a MultiSelect list, adding a
' fruit, Esc), the View menu by mouse (focus events off), Help > About,
' then Ctrl+F4 refused by Form_Unload's MsgBox. (The Timer form is left
' out: it shows the time.)
Name=demo
Startup=frmDemo
Form=../../examples/demo/main.bas
Form=../../examples/demo/controls.bas
Form=../../examples/demo/lists.bas
Form=../../examples/demo/timer.bas
Module=../../examples/demo/events.bas
